<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">We have received your registration and are thrilled to have you join the event. We look forward to seeing you there.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>When</strong></span>: Friday, June 2nd, 2023 from 6:20pm (match starts at 7:50pm)</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>Where</strong></span>: Private Suite of the Melbourne Cricket Ground (The "G")</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><span style="color: #147bd1;"><strong>What</strong></span>: Access to Flywire’s private suite during the Melbourne vs Carlton match, grazing gourmet menu and premium beverages, and networking fun with the Flywire team!</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Please keep an eye on your email for further updates as we get closer to the event date. </span><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">In the meantime, if you have any questions or concerns, please do not hesitate to reach out to <a href="mailto:angela@flywire.com"><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>angela@flywire.com</u></strong></span></a>.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Best regards,</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: center;">The Flywire Team</p> </td> 
